<para>The returned point is in local coordinates, that is, the shape&apos;s transforms (position, rotation, scale) are not taken into account. The result is undefined if <computeroutput>index</computeroutput> is out of the valid range.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
