<parameterdescription>
<para>Index of the point to get, in range [0 .. <ref refid="classsf_1_1ConvexShape_1a10ab81b7646e7b94c2d0390c99cb67cd" kindref="member">getPointCount()</ref> - 1]</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
